  <section class="section roles"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Three connected perspectives</div><h2>Each person sees the tools they need.</h2><p class="lead">The same marketplace data moves through dedicated administration, seller, and buyer experiences.</p><div class="role-flow">
    <div class="role"><strong>Administrator</strong><ul><li>Configure modules and settings</li><li>Moderate users and listings</li><li>Manage payments and subscriptions</li><li>Review reports and activity</li></ul></div>
    <div class="role"><strong>Seller</strong><ul><li>Create vertical-aware listings</li><li>Handle orders and customer actions</li><li>Track inventory and performance</li><li>Manage wallet and withdrawals</li></ul></div>
    <div class="role"><strong>Buyer</strong><ul><li>Discover and save listings</li><li>Chat with marketplace sellers</li><li>Buy, book, apply, or inquire</li><li>Track account activity</li></ul></div>
  </div></div></section>
